.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-3-Clause
.Dd September 30, 2026
.Dt PERIODIC.CONF 5
.Os OxideBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm periodic.conf
.Nd settings for the periodic maintenance scripts
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Xr periodic 8
and its scripts read
.Pa /etc/defaults/periodic.conf ,
which holds the defaults and must not be edited, and then the files that its
.Va periodic_conf_files
names,
.Pa /etc/periodic.conf
and
.Pa /etc/periodic.conf.local ,
whichever exist, where local settings go.
Like
.Xr rc.conf 5 ,
they are
.Xr sh 1
assignments; a flag is on when its value is
.Dq YES .
.Pp
For each run, where
.Ar name
is
.Dq daily ,
.Dq weekly ,
.Dq monthly ,
or the name of another directory of scripts:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ar name Ns Va _output
Where the kept output goes: a file to append it to, if a path; a user, if a
name; the standard output, if empty.
The defaults are
.Pa /var/log/daily.log ,
.Pa /var/log/weekly.log
and
.Pa /var/log/monthly.log .
.It Ar name Ns Va _show_success
Keep the output of scripts that found nothing notable.
Default
.Dq YES .
.It Ar name Ns Va _show_info
Keep the output of scripts that found something.
Default
.Dq YES .
.It Ar name Ns Va _show_badconfig
Keep the output of scripts whose settings are invalid.
Default
.Dq NO .
.El
.Pp
The scripts' own settings:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va daily_clean_tmps_enable
Remove old files in
.Va daily_clean_tmps_dirs .
Default
.Dq NO .
.It Va daily_clean_tmps_dirs
The directories to clean; default
.Pa /tmp .
.It Va daily_clean_tmps_days
Remove files neither read nor changed for this many days; default 3.
.It Va daily_clean_tmps_ignore
Names, and
.Xr find 1
patterns, of files never to remove; default the lock files and sockets of
X11 and its relatives.
.It Va daily_backup_passwd_enable
Report changes to the account files and keep copies in
.Pa /var/backups .
Default
.Dq YES .
.It Va daily_status_disks_enable
Show how full each file system is.
Default
.Dq YES .
.It Va daily_status_disks_df_flags
Flags to
.Xr df 1 ;
default
.Fl h .
.It Va daily_status_uptime_enable
Show the uptime and load.
Default
.Dq YES .
.It Va daily_local , weekly_local , monthly_local
Files of local commands, run by
.Xr sh 1
last; defaults
.Pa /etc/daily.local ,
.Pa /etc/weekly.local
and
.Pa /etc/monthly.local .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /etc/defaults/periodic.conf -compact
.It Pa /etc/defaults/periodic.conf
the defaults
.It Pa /etc/periodic.conf
local settings
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
Clean
.Pa /tmp
of files older than a week, and log the daily output instead of keeping a
file of it:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
daily_clean_tmps_enable="YES"
daily_clean_tmps_days="7"
daily_output="root"
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr rc.conf 5 ,
.Xr periodic 8
.Sh HISTORY
A
.Nm
file appeared in
.Fx 4.0 .
